      <article class="bd-card">
        <div class="bd-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M2 9h20"/><path d="M8 21h8"/><path d="M12 18v3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>24/7 Online Ordering</h3>
        <p>Place and track orders anytime through our exclusive ordering platform — real-time catalogs, dealer pricing, and easy reordering, with no waiting on business hours.</p>
        <a class="bd-link" href="{{ site.links.online_ordering }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Access online ordering &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="bd-card">
        <div class="bd-ico orange"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M9 21V9"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Showroom Designer Platform</h3>
        <p>Plan product placement, optimize your floor layout, and build a more profitable product mix with our exclusive Showroom Designer — turn square footage into sales.</p>
        <a class="bd-link" href="#showroom">See how it works &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="bd-card">
        <div class="bd-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.7 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.4 0"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Expert Sales &amp; Dealer Support</h3>
        <p>Tap into deep product knowledge, staff training and in-services, literature, technical support, and hands-on sales assistance from a team that knows these lines.</p>
        <a class="bd-link" href="/dealer-support/?request=Request%20an%20In-Service">Request an in-service &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="bd-card">
        <div class="bd-ico orange"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 21h18"/><path d="M5 21V7l7-4 7 4v14"/><path d="M9 21v-6h6v6"/><path d="M9 11h.01M15 11h.01"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Showroom &amp; Business Development</h3>
        <p>Hands-on showroom walkthroughs, merchandising guidance, sales training, marketing support, and business-development tools that help your storefront grow.</p>
        <a class="bd-link" href="/consulting/">Request a showroom consultation &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="bd-card">
        <div class="bd-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h13v18H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2.5z"/><path d="M8 7h8M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg></div>
